# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27211 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_aa8f1987:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Hopefully the time they spend together will make them closer.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27212 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_835c66b8:
msgid "[_R_] Hey, ladies!"
msgstr "[_R_] Ei, senhoritas!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27215 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_52b64459:
msgid "[_S_] Hey, [ryan]. What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "[_S_] Ei, [ryan]. O que você está fazendo aqui fora?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27216 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_13b9bd66:
msgid "[_R_] Just checking on you two. How the hell are those weeds back already?"
msgstr "[_R_] Só verificando vocês dois. Como o inferno já são ervas daninhas?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27217 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_4262cd0a:
msgid "[_M_] Well, if you don't get the roots, they come back."
msgstr "[_M_] Bem, se você não pegar as raízes, elas voltarão."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27218 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_63539d3f:
msgid "[_R_] I swear I got them all."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27219 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_a84c96ca:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I think...{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27222 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_578158c9:
msgid "[_M_] They're not easy to get. We've been working on them for a while. Now, my back is killing me!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27223 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_1415aa3f:
msgid "[_S_] God, me too!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27226 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_f83610de:
msgid "[_M_] It may be hard, but it'll be worth it when it's done."
msgstr "[_M_] talvez seja difícil, mas valerá a pena quando terminar."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27227 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_90d3574e:
msgid "[_S_] I know it takes some work to prepare the soil, but I can't wait until we actually get planting!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27228 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_05a999ec:
msgid "[_M_] I know I'm looking forward to the fresh garden herbs for my cooking."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27229 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_10d7b1c8:
msgid "[_S_] I still think we should make all those other upgrades to the yard you were talking about, too."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27230 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_43d69855:
msgid "[_S_] I'd just love to soak it up in a hot tub at night."
msgstr "[_S_] Eu só gostaria de absorvê-la em uma banheira quente à noite."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27231 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_7c61235a:
msgid "[_R_] Maybe I can start setting aside some of our money for those upgrades?"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27232 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_b83738ec:
msgid "[_M_] You just focus on paying off that Mafia debt your father saddled us with, please!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27233 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_8a6eae8e:
msgid "[_M_] Everything else can wait."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27234 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_56181615:
msgid "[_S_] Not too much longer, if you want us to ever enjoy it. We aren't going to live with you forever."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27235 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_f8e3e6ab:
msgid "[_M_] Well, I think you should. I never want any of you to leave!"
msgstr "[_M_] Bem, eu acho que você deveria. Eu nunca quero que nenhum de vocês saia!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27236 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_ef7543b1:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Yeah, no one can leave! I've got to turn this into our own little \"home sweet harem\" before it's too late.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Sim, ninguém pode partir! Eu tenho que transformar isso em nosso pequeno cabelo doce antes que seja tarde demais.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27237 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_2100b1f0:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I'd better get to work on these two... Nothing like a helping hand to win over favor.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}é melhor começar a trabalhar nestes dois... Nada como uma mão de ajuda para ganhar favor.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27240 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_53c225ec:
msgid "[_R_] Well, since you two have been so busy, why don't you go relax in what's left of the evening sun before it's gone."
msgstr "[_R_] Bem, já que vocês dois estão tão ocupados, por que não relaxar o que restará do sol da noite antes que ele se vá."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27241 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_1f9aeed7:
msgid "[_R_] I'll finish getting those weeds. Don't worry, I'll even make an extra effort to get the roots."
msgstr "[_R_] Vou terminar de pegar essas ervas daninhas. Não se preocupe, eu até farei um esforço extra para conseguir as raízes."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27242 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_de06a3f4:
msgid "[_M_] Really?... You'd do that for us, again?"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27243 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_f2f3d39d:
msgid "[_S_] Thanks, [ryan]!"
msgstr "[_S_] Obrigado, [ryan]!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27246 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_238959ca:
msgid "[_M_] {i}(Talking quietly){/i} What a sweety! He's sure been extra helpful lately."
msgstr "[_M_] {i}(Falando silenciosamente){/i} Que doce! Tem certeza que foi extra útil ultimamente."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27247 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_fe8521a8:
msgid "[_S_] {i}(Talking quietly){/i} Makes me wonder what he's after."
msgstr "[_S_] {i}(Falando silenciosamente){/i} me faz perguntar o que ele vai fazer."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27248 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_a6f4642d:
msgid "[_M_] It doesn't mean he's after anything, I think he's just stepping up."
msgstr "[_M_] não significa que ele está atrás de nada, acho que ele só está aumentando."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27249 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_47581028:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}But he probably is after something as well.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Mas ele provavelmente vai depois de algo também.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27255 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_a4b27ae0:
msgid "[_R_] Phew!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27256 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_28e9c529:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Boy, this is hard work.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Garoto, este é um trabalho duro.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27257 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_38b01be4:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}These weeds are tough to get out.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Estas ervas daninhas são difíceis de sair.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27260 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_21e78759:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Oh, Here they come.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27261 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_d7af1b05:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}To see them come out the door dressed like that makes all this work worth it!{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Para vê-los saem pela porta vestida como esta faz com que todo esse trabalho valha a pena!{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27265 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_16bbad46:
msgid "[_M_] No, He said that!?"
msgstr "[_M_] Não, ele disse isso!?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27266 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_b1e7f392:
msgid "[_S_] He did, and Armani didn't even flinch! I kind of think she liked it!"
msgstr "[_S_] Ele fez, e Armani nem sequer pisou! Eu acho que ela gostou!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27269 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_84d7d320:
msgid "[_M_] Well, when you practically grow up in a strip club..."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27270 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_e9493899:
msgid "[_M_] I'm so glad you're not going there every Monday anymore!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27271 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_d895878a:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}God, they are both so sexy!{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27274 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_0b3e2796:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Well, at least I'll have a nice view while I finish up here.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Bem, pelo menos eu terei uma vista agradável enquanto termino aqui.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27277 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_7f5d2a7d:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Alright, you bastards! Time to meet my friend Mr. Shovel{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27283 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_66b9441f:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Phew... That evening sun is right in my face.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27284 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_f1de67ad:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}But I'm all done.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Mas estou pronto.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27287 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_52b57ded:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I've got to say, it feels good to finish something challenging.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27290 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_0bfbe2f5:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}It also feels nice to do something to help out the girls.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}também é legal fazer algo para ajudar as garotas. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27291 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_94619fe2:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I know my motives are usually pretty selfish, but it does feel good to make them happy too.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27294 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_00fcc093:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Now, I'd say I deserve to reward myself with some eye candy.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27297 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_b5d46fd1:
msgid "[_R_] How's that sun feeling today?"
msgstr "[_R_] Como aquele sol está se sentindo hoje?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27298 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_3b0f402c:
msgid "[_M_] Mmm... So nice! It's just so wonderful to relax and talk with Sidney. Thanks for taking over our chore so we could do this!"
msgstr "[_M_] Mmm... Tão legal! É tão maravilhoso relaxar e conversar com Sidney. Obrigado por assumir o nosso minério para que pudéssemos fazer isso!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27299 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_999dc229:
msgid "[_R_] My pleasure."
msgstr "[_R_] Meu prazer."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27300 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_c68a10cd:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, how's the sunscreen situation? I hope you both have protection?"
msgstr "[_R_] Oh, como é a situação do filtro solar? Espero que vocês dois tenham proteção?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27301 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_4e489bed:
msgid "[_ST_] {i}God!... That sounded like a sleazy condom joke. Is he being gross on purpose?{/i}"
msgstr "[_ST_] {i}Deus!... Parece uma brincadeira de preservativo enevoada. Será que ele é grosseiro?{/i} de propósito?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27302 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_97d24665:
msgid "[_M_] We were just about to put some on. It's been warming up in the sun."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27307 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_0d19178c:
msgid "[_R_] You girls should both just relax this time and let me apply your sunscreen for you."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27308 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_ec56d3e0:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}I don't know if I should encourage him, but it would be nice to have some more manly hands on my back again.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Eu não sei se eu deveria encorajá-lo, mas seria bom ter mais algumas mãos mansas nas costas novamente.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27309 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_0f06c112:
msgid "[_S_] Oh, I'm sure you'd love that, wouldn't you perv? I think Mom and I can handle putting sunscreen on ourselves."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27310 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_e867aa55:
msgid "[_ST_] {i}Get lost, Bro! I'm finally reconnecting with Mom. Don't ruin this for us.{/i}"
msgstr "[_ST_] {i}Perde-se, Bro! Finalmente estou me reconectando com a mãe. Não estrague isso para us.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27311 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_8d95f5f9:
msgid "[_M_] Sidney! Don't be so rude to your brother. He just did us a big favor. [ryan], thank you for weeding the garden so we could relax."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27312 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_5c28c9b2:
msgid "[_S_] But Mom!..."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27313 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_3ae20de7:
msgid "[_M_] Don't \"but Mom\" me... Give your brother the sunscreen."
msgstr "[_M_] Não \"exceto mãe\" eu... Dê ao seu irmão filtro solar."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27316 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_58bfc50d:
msgid "[_M_] You can put some on my back. Honey."
msgstr "[_M_] Você pode colocar um pouco nas minhas costas. Querido."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27317 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_6cfec4f5:
msgid "[_S_] Ugh, fine, take it dweeb. Try not to drool on her, yeah?"
msgstr "[_S_] Ugh, tudo bem, pegue-o. Tente não cair nela, sim?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27318 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_4dd23e1c:
msgid "[_R_] Hey, I'm just making sure you two don't get sunburned. It's my job now, to take care of you ladies."
msgstr "[_R_] Ei, eu só estou me certificando de que você dois não fiquem queimados do sol. É meu trabalho agora mesmo, cuidar de suas senhoras."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27319 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_ed4b459a:
msgid "[_S_] We can take care of ourselves without you butting into our mother daughter time."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27320 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_b0e8ee21:
msgid "[_M_] Don't fight, you two... Sidney, we're still spending time together. Just think of him as our personal cabin boy."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27321 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_3f2b04ea:
msgid "[_R_] Boy?"
msgstr "[_R_] Menino?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27322 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_f2cff6b2:
msgid "[_M_] Fine, our personal cabin man. Happy? Now get to it before I burn!"
msgstr "[_M_] Beleza, nosso homem de cabine pessoal. Fez? Agora vá até ele antes que eu queime!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27323 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_7dd48781:
msgid "[_R_] Ha... Yes Ma'am! By the time I'm done, you'll be completely protected from those harsh UV rays."
msgstr "[_R_] Ha... Sim, Mim! No tempo que terminar, você estará completamente protegido contra esses raios pesados de uV."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27324 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_122b14b0:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, my savior!"
msgstr "[_M_] Oh, meu salvador!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27327 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_5634fd17:
msgid "[_M_] See? He's just being nice. You should try to find a man who looks out for you like your brother does for us."
msgstr "[_M_] Vê? Ele está apenas sendo legal. Você deveria tentar achar um homem que te cuide, como o seu irmão faz por nós."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27328 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_85508244:
msgid "[_S_] Yeah, right... I don't think there's anyone else on the planet like him. Thank God!"
msgstr "[_S_] Sim, certo... Eu não acho que haja mais ninguém no planeta como ele. Obrigado!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27331 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_633b0ac6:
msgid "[_R_] Do you want me to rub your back while I'm at it? You said it was sore earlier?"
msgstr "[_R_] Quer que eu esfrege suas costas enquanto estou nele? Você disse que já estava dolorido?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27332 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_6f0a5558:
msgid "[_M_] That'd be lovely! Thank you, Honey."
msgstr "[_M_] Isso seria adorável! Obrigado, querido."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27333 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_022ee5c6:
msgid "[_S_] Hey, you didn't say you were giving back rubs. I want one."
msgstr "[_S_] Ei, você não disse que estava dando os problemas. Eu quero um."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27334 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_92bfb7b6:
msgid "[_M_] You'll have to wait your turn. I get him first."
msgstr "U[_M_] você terá que esperar a sua vez. Eu pego ele primeiro."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27337 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_d3db83c6:
msgid "[_M_] Mmm... That feels wonderful! You have magic hands."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27338 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_e939ed83:
msgid "[_R_] I'm glad someone appreciates me."
msgstr "U[_R_] Estou feliz que alguém me aprecie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27339 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_729b9e6b:
msgid "[_S_] Oh, Haha... Just hurry up. I want my turn."
msgstr "[_S_] Oh, Haha... Só se apresse. Eu quero minha vez."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27340 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_ccc89831:
msgid "[_R_] No way, unlike you, Mom was nice to me. I'm going to be extra thorough with her. I'm not even sure I want to give you a back rub."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27341 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_87fa3eb5:
msgid "[_S_] I was just teasing. Come on, I'm grateful for everything you've been doing for the family. Really!"
msgstr "[_S_] Eu só estava brincando. Vamos lá, eu estou grato por tudo que você tem feito pela família. Sério!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27342 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_18536968:
msgid "[_R_] I don't know..."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27345 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_6600d952:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Listen to these two. I used to find their bickering so irritating, but right now.... with my life turned upside down, it's comforting in a way. I could almost think everything was normal again.{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:27346 #-#-# translate crowdin label_girl_time_garden_374aeffa:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}It really is nice having Sidney back home. Thank God she saw reason and agreed to stop working in Joey's club. God only knows what being exposed to all that depravity would have done to her.{/i}"
