# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:29985 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_ntr_blackmail_7b2028df:
msgid "[_MB_] Yeah, but a school board hearing would make this all very public, and I think people's imaginations will make them believe that much more is going on between you and [ryan]."
